{
  "name": "dsh-puzzle-mode",
  "version": "2.4.18",
  "description": "DSH 插件：拼图模式——**全局项目工作台**。把项目拆成主文档 + 模块文档，AI 主动提问把不确定项变成已定项，用五维算健康性。**派单系统**：五列看板（卡折叠成只显示标题的小卡，点开浮窗看详情；**卡上不放按钮，移动即触发**——「未接单」拖到「在做」= 真的开工）+ 新建任务单 + 全局大脑 + 澄清器 + 派单执行，四处模型可配；**看板按项目隔离**（`<数据工作区>/拼图/<项目名>/派单.json`），**执行工作区默认在拼图项目文件夹内**。**全局大脑**：一个项目一个常驻会话，其上下文里的拼图文档段没压缩时冻结、压缩时重读；澄清器从它 fork 出来（继承事件日志）。入口常驻左侧边栏，第一屏是工作区项目列表，点一行进二级（文档信息 / 派单系统）。另有自动更新、主题开发与分享、文件观察守卫。文档格式 v9；与 dsh-infinite-gen-5 按契约共存。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "test",
    "tools",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "UI.md",
    "PUBLISH.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "COMPAT.md",
    "compat.json"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/smoke.test.mjs",
    "verify:cross": "node tools/verify-cross-plugin.mjs",
    "verify:install-spec": "node tools/check-install-spec.mjs"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "puzzle",
    "project-docs"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation"
      ]
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "^0.1.5-alpha.1 || ^0.1.6-alpha.1 || ^0.1.7-alpha.1 || ^0.2.0-rc.1"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/liancha22/dsh-puzzle-mode.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/liancha22/dsh-puzzle-mode#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/liancha22/dsh-puzzle-mode/issues"
  },
  "author": "liancha22 <1784351702@qq.com>",
  "devDependencies": {
    "marked": "^16.4.2"
  }
}
